config MT6797_HIF_CORE
	bool "MT6797 private WLAN HIF transport core"
	depends on ARM64 && COMPILE_TEST
	default n
	help
	  Build the private ordered AHB transport and bounded ordinary INIT
	  section implementation. There is no platform probe or runtime caller
	  until a real CONSYS owner supplies the required powered mapping and
	  exclusion. This option does not provide a usable Wi-Fi device.
